### ✅ Key Principles Applied
- **`tests/__init__.py`** — required so pytest can import modules from your app
- **Interface-first** — `test_executor.py` & `test_compute_service.py` test **only the ABC**, never BytePlus directly
- **Implementation isolated** — `tests/providers/test_byteplus_ecs.py` validates only the BytePlus implementation
- **Schema validated** — `test_planner.py` ensures output always matches `AgentTask` (never free-form strings)

